.alias R_BYT0            $4300    ;Read: switch byte 0, active low. D7 left fire/start, D6 right fire/start, D5 spare 1, D4 self test, D3 slam, D2 aux coin, D1 left coin, D0 right coin.
.alias S_COINA           $4300    ;PLAIN AND SIMPLE STRAIGHT SWITCH INPUTS
