.alias scratch_2         $4802    ;shared scratch byte of the direct page: Atari's TMPLIN and TMPTP2 in the carried lines. bank 1's NVRAM code counts bytes in it, and page 1's indicator code keeps the x of the last mark drawn in the word that starts here, which takes in the first byte of scratch_3
.alias scratch_3         $4803    ;shared scratch of the direct page, a word in most uses: Atari's TMPDY, TMPOCT, TMPSIZ and TMPTP3 in the carried lines. among others the larger of the two distances in the octagon distance routines of the pages, the pen y of title_outline and jedi_letter_strokes and the y distance left to the sight in view_lazars
.alias scratch_5         $4805    ;shared scratch of the direct page: Atari's TMPXD in the carried lines. the intensity bits of the vector being written in title_outline and jedi_letter_strokes, and in astrd_lz_test first the saved X, then the asteroid's radius on the screen
.alias scratch_6         $4806    ;shared scratch byte of the direct page: jedi_letter_strokes keeps the offset of the point it draws to here
