.alias w4_level          $4C4E    ;level of the asteroid part: a copy of GM_WAV made by begin_act_init when a wave begins. twice it plus diff_adder is that part's fire_level, and page 2 takes the number of asteroids in flight from it (P2_95B5). (the TIE fighter part's level is SP_WAV)
