.alias jedi_time         $4C50    ;3 bytes, the last a fraction: time left of the state that follows the completion of the four Jedi letters, the Jedi force. page 1 sets the top word to $01C0 when the fourth letter is earned and counts it down every frame (P1_95F1) at a rate picked by jedi_count. 0 = not running, the game start clears the top word. while it runs the cockpit and the lazar splash take the force colour and the shield gauge is not drawn, under $60 they blink on its bit 3. the setups of the walker, TIE fighter and asteroid parts send their music only when it is under $80
