.alias w2_spawn_a        $4C64    ;walker part: spawn count of the AT-STs on page 1 (atst_move_all, atst_place), 3 from atst_init and 0 in the training manual. while it is above 0 a free record among the first w2_spawn_a gets a new AT-ST, one a frame, and a destroyed one is placed anew. minus ($FF from the end of the part) frees every AT-ST that was not in view in the last frame
