.alias astrd_max         $4C67    ;asteroid field: most asteroids in flight at once, 3 to 10 by wave number (P2_95B5). $FF (minus) = field stopped, no more are launched and those not marked are removed: set 40 frames before the wave ends and when the player dies in it
